    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EX EZ</strong> is an intuitive XR virtual production solution that runs smoothly on gaming-laptop-level hardware.<br>With easy camera movement, UI-based controls, and chroma-key &amp; color correction features, anyone can create high-quality virtual content effortlessly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unreal Engine\u2013based virtual environment composited with live camera (NDI) feed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save &amp; recall up to 4 camera positions, with smooth path-based movement playback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed chroma-key controls (alpha, luma, divisor, intensity)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full color grading (gamma, gain, brightness, contrast, saturation, hue shift)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for PPT, video files, or NDI input as content boards, with size &amp; rotation adjustment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant background switching via EXR HDRIs or 360\u00b0 media slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F10 key to invoke map-switching UI</p></li></ul>",
